\": \"A tutor separately asks whether a closing that feels too casual after correct opening keigo deserves a penalty.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939293.000156\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U004\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939293.000156\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d3\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"The team lead requested beginning and ending forms in the QA tutor's scoring thread and the casual-closing thread; neither thread includes those forms or a completed assessment.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876384.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939387.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876285.000158\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876339.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902834.000157\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902881.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902925.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939293.000156\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939349.000113\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U007\", \"relation\": \"THREAD_STARTER\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876384.000226\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U004\", \"relation\": \"THREAD_STARTER\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939387.000226\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U001\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876384.000226\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U001\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939387.000226\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d4\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"QA tutors ask whether discourse explains the shift in all three threads, but the supplied replies do not settle that question.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876339.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902925.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939349.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876285.000158\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876384.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902834.000157\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902881.000113\