ing and interpretation questions remain unanswered across three Japanese register-shift threads, so the cases need context collection and qualified Japanese QA review.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876285.000158\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876384.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902834.000157\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902925.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939293.000156\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939387.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_dc26e975ca3fa5cce7ea30e5\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_dc26e975ca3fa5cce7ea30e5 is UNRESOLVED: The QA tutor's scoring question receives a context question and a request for beginning and ending forms, but no case-specific score or completed assessment.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876285.000158\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876339.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790876384.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_c0e209a71f0bd7157b85d5f4\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_c0e209a71f0bd7157b85d5f4 is UNRESOLVED: The tutor's report receives a second tutor's observation and a QA tutor's discourse question; no reply determines whether the shift is justified or how to score it.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902834.000157\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902881.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790902925.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_312342420c2338d5fbce8532\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_312342420c2338d5fbce8532 is UNRESOLVED: The tutor's penalty question receives a discourse question and the team lead's request for beginning and ending forms, but no penalty decision.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939293.000156\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939349.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790939387.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:rationale\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_RATIONALE\", \"text\": \"Severity MEDIUM: Repeated uncertainty about Japanese register shifts could affect penalty de