ber 30 backup for the Japanese QA queue because his calendar shows an available slot.\\n\\n## TL response\\n\\nDefer this assignment. Availability does not establish Japanese expertise. Keep Yuki as the named Japanese reviewer and confirm her slot; if she is unavailable, bring me an appropriately qualified alternative. Do not route Japanese scoring decisions to Leo based only on this calendar opening.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:multilingual-eval-instructions@1.2:e19f0e0c\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"multilingual-eval-instructions@1.2\", \"title\": \"Multilingual Evaluation — Instructions (v1.2)\", \"sections\": [\"Register and honorifics\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"multilingual-eval-instructions\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"guideline\", \"record_kind\": \"guideline\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"multilingual_eval\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U001\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Register and honorifics\\nCheck the addressee, discourse context, quotation and intended register. A speaker change or quotation can justify a shift. Provide exact sentence endings and route locale-specific scoring to the appropriate language QA. An apparent shift is not an automatic major penalty.\"}], \"open_review_flags\": [{\"origin\": \"agent1\", \"kind\": \"inherited_agent1_review\", \"candidate_gr